# PEP 561 marker: this package ships inline type annotations.
#
# Without this file, mypy and pyright ignore every annotation in the package
# and treat `avsb` as untyped, however well annotated the source is. Its
# presence is what makes `server.get_bool_flag("k", False, ctx)` type-check at
# the call site.
#
# The file is intentionally not empty so its purpose survives a code review.
